WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.132
One simple way to un pivot data is to use union all.

00:00:04.132 --> 00:00:11.142
We write one select statement for January, another for February, and another for March.

00:00:11.142 --> 00:00:14.817
Each select returns the same column structure.

00:00:14.817 --> 00:00:18.367
Then union all stacks those rows together.

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:25.639
This approach is repetitive, but it is easy to understand because each source column is handled explicitly.
